	(text "Adapter: 12 V DC, 2 A or more, regulated, plug 5.5 x 2.1 mm, either polarity.\nF1 limits a fault current. The four diodes D9-D12 pass the current the right way round whatever the polarity of the plug.\nD14 clamps voltage spikes (plugging in a live adapter). D13 lets VIN_SENSE fall at once when the plug is pulled, while C53 keeps the converters fed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 27.94 0)
